sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P1 as Publisher A
    participant P2 as Publisher B
    participant DB as PostgreSQL outbox
    participant Dest as Destination

    Note over P1,DB: Claim query selects pending rows whose<br/>available_at has passed, plus claimed rows<br/>whose claim_expires_at has passed,<br/>ordered by available_at then created_at,<br/>LIMIT batch, FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED.

    P1->>DB: ClaimPending(batch 10, owner publisher-a)
    DB-->>P1: rows locked by A become claimed, 60s lease
    P2->>DB: ClaimPending(batch 10, owner publisher-b)
    DB-->>P2: overlapping rows skipped by SKIP LOCKED

    P1->>Dest: Send effect with effect_id as idempotency key
    alt accepted
        Dest-->>P1: success
        P1->>DB: MarkDelivered, claim columns cleared
    else failed and attempts remain
        Dest-->>P1: error
        P1->>DB: ScheduleRetry, status pending, available_at in the future
    else attempts reached max_attempts
        Dest-->>P1: error
        P1->>DB: Quarantine effect and write a quarantine row
    end

    Note over DB: A crashed publisher leaves rows claimed.<br/>After claim_expires_at passes another<br/>publisher claims them again.

    P2->>DB: ClaimPending after the lease expires
    DB-->>P2: expired claimed rows returned as claimed again
    P2->>Dest: Send the same effect_id
    Dest-->>P2: deduplicated, treated as delivered
    P2->>DB: MarkDelivered
